Stafford Phillips asks "I was hoping there is
something in an initialization file that would prevent S+ from automatically
selecting factor, actually if it never used factor again, that would be
ideal."

 After a multi-year campaign, I finally got StatSci to include the
        stringsAsFactors
option as a global choice.  Set it to F.  
Exactly which release this occurred in I cannot say.

  Here at Mayo, we made the necessary changes to Splus for said option over
6 years ago, it is set to F as part of the system-wide options, and no one
has ever missed it.  (There are over 100 regular S users in the group).

  We also set na.action to na.omit and contrasts to 'treatment'; two other
options whose default values were a mistake.

   Terry Therneau
   

