thanks to Dimitris C. Rizopoulos and Frederic Gosselin for their useful
help. the problem has to do with the handling of contrasts.

splus have the helmert contasts as default contrasts:

intersept: represents mean level of SC10M for the
three levels of your factor.

as.factor(OQTOTK1)1: difference betwenn level 2 and
level 1.

as.factor(OQTOTK1)2: twice the difference between
level 3 and the average of level 1 and level 2.

you may want to change to treatment contrasts by
using:
options(contrasts=c("contr.treatment", "contr.poly"))
if you use this type of contrasts then:

intersept: represents level 1 of OQTOTK1.

as.factor(OQTOTK1)1: difference betwenn level 2 and
level 1.

as.factor(OQTOTK1)2: difference betwenn level 3 and
level 1.

